--- !u!114 &2129457624
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2129457623}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 66f14511c1ca30b44b628a00196b299f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueHandler
  combatTrigger: {fileID: 186737153}
  inputActions: {fileID: -944628639613478452, guid: 052faaac586de48259a63d0c4782560b, type: 3}
  TextCanv: {fileID: 1394950306}
  Player: {fileID: 1478224543}
  LanceBlock: {fileID: 484649845}
  Button1: {fileID: 194756675}
  Button2: {fileID: 370744382}
  Button3: {fileID: 518966065}
  CharName: 1
  DisplayText: "Heyyyy, bitch! Thought it would be a hot minute before you'd be back.
    You\u2019re full of spunk and moxie :3; Damn, you\u2019re not looking too hot.
    Otis! Get this cutie another drink. So anyway, you ready to party some more?
    :); OTIS: Hey, kid, if you still don\u2019t got your shit figured out, she\u2019s
    probably your best bet.; You two were playin\u2019 each other, drinkin\u2019,
    dancin\u2019\u2013 almost all night.; Aahh, we had fun! I saw you tearing my
    lackeys to shreds\u2013  I mean, you were one BAMF!; I had to let you play with
    me and the other big dawgs.Not my fault you got a little carried away. But who
    cares?; It was all in good fun :); Well, I definitely gave you a run for your
    money, but I\u2019m not the one who beat your ass.; I couldn\u2019t give you
    what you wanted, but I could get you the next best thing. So that's what I did.;
    You know better than that! If you want something, you gotta play :3; I can\u2019t
    tell you what you wanted, but if you win? I could tell you where to go next~
    x; You know what I want? I wanna know why you came here last night.; No, silly!
    I mean why here? You could have gone to so many other places, but you chose here.
    I wanna know why.; Damn, bitch! Have another round on me :)  I was hoping you\u2019d
    win. You need a little pick-me-up.; A deals a deal. You wanna speak to Lance
    in the back. Don\u2019t be a stranger now, k? ; You really don\u2019t know when
    to quit, do you? XP Of all the places, why here? "
  ButtonText: "Are you talking to me?; Uh\u2026 Hi?; Hey, biatch!;  Do I know you?;
    Sorry, I\u2019m a little busy right now.; You look like a mistake I already made.; 
    ...;  I guess we really hit it off, huh?; Ah. You\u2019re probably why I feel
    like shit.;  ...;  ...;  I hear I lost big time to ya.; Glad you enjoyed kicking
    my ass.;  ...;  Who did then?; What did I want so bad?; What did I lose?;  ...; 
    And what do you want?; You want my name, too?;  I don\u2019t know.; Uh, yeahhh,
    me too?;  Deal. ; I feel like I\u2019m going to regret this.;  ...;  Got it;
    Retry "
  TextOBJ: {fileID: 1105010927}
  BarMusicOBJ: {fileID: 255530400}
  BattleMusicOBJ: {fileID: 116659735}
  OtisBattleTheme: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a28e441d20a59514fb9bb9ae21157ecc, type: 3}
  AgaliaBattleTheme: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d119bedc2b913cd478398470ba301e1e, type: 3}
  LanceBattleTheme: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a14895e4e21ea4d44afebc9be7b641da, type: 3}
  WinTheme: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e5f757bbbbbda64195ab53b83bcc148, type: 3}
  LossTheme: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 43706cb1364d5e6468a15139b4f621ac, type: 3}
  roundOverEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fabf0db1727fdc84d8d0f8e93f55048e, type: 2}
